    "title": "Pine Island man drowns while kayaking - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bryan Fumagalli ,\n1 days ago Pine Island resident Scott N. Meyer lost his life on July 4 in what police believe was a drowning accident while kayaking in the Sullivan County town of Rockland. On July 4, at approximately 8:48 p.m., New York State Police assigned to Liberty responded to a report of an overturned kayaker at Mongaup Pond Campground, located at 231 Mongaup Pond Road. Read full article",
